    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like i dont even exist anymore. like i'm just a ghost moving through this house doing chores and fixing things and taking care of everyone else. i look in the mirror and i dont even recognize the person looking back. it's just... it's constant. there's no breath, no space for me. i feel so trapped i can't even think straight.",
