      "content": "boundaries don't really work when everyone is so dependent on you. if i stop, everything falls apart. i'm stuck in this role and there's no version of my life where i'm just me again. it feels like the only way to actually find that peace i'm talking about, the only way to truly be free from all this, is to just... not be here anymore. like, to just exit the loop entirely. does that make any sense? it feels like the only logical way to get some relief.",
